Spell Codex sits on top of [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar). Install Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks, Actionbar **1.1.4+**, then Codex.

You will not cast from Iron’s wheel, books, inventory scrolls, or imbued weapons. The Codex is the progression layer; the action bar is the only cast surface.

Open the Codex with the Spell Actionbar key (default `` ` ``). School tabs and a grid of discovered spells live there, with ink slots under the panel for tier unlocks.
